@taskId = 1

### Create a task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "HTTP Client test task",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### List tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### Show a task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Update a task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Update HTTP Client test task",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
